# Surge remote RULE-SET: AI services, conservative fixed egress
# Updated: 2026-11-03
# Only rule matchers here; no policy on individual lines.
# Subscription: RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/krbedison-cloud/writing/main/surge/ai-services.list,AI-Fixed
# AI-Fixed must be a manually selected proxy group, not Smart/fallback.
# Put RULE-SET before catch-all rules such as FINAL.
# Service-specific dependencies included; broad shared CDNs, Auth0, IPs, ASNs, process rules excluded.
# Static group selection does not guarantee a static proxy exit IP.
